        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Falling Stars\n- Companies: Ivolgamus, Nordcurrent, Agetec\n- Places: Europe, North America\n- Topics: role-playing video games, casual games, Freemium games, gaming platforms\n\nFacts:\n- Falling Stars is a role-playing video game developed by Ivolgamus.\n- Falling Stars is published by Nordcurrent in Europe.\n- Falling Stars is published by Agetec in North America.\n- Nordcurrent is a Lithuanian and international developer and publisher.\n- Nordcurrent develops and publishes casual games and Freemium games.\n- Nordcurrent targets the iOS, Android, Amazon, PC, and Mac platforms.",
